Package: tidyWaste
Title: Easily Install and Load the 'tidyWaste' Family of Packages
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Robin", "Shannon", email = "rjs@robinshannon.net",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: The 'tidyWaste' family provides a coherent toolkit for
    environmental analysis in waste-management operations. This meta-package
    installs and loads its member packages in a single step: 'hydroSense' for
    detecting and assessing landfill-leachate impacts on freshwater quality,
    and 'meteoHazard' for turning meteorological data into management-relevant
    hazard predictions and warnings.
